WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Meet my Simple Calculator project, built with Python.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
First, I type 12 as the first number and choose the plus operator.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Next, I give the calculator the second number, 30.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Instantly, the answer appears on the screen: 42.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Thanks for watching!